OL,3,AInterest rates hold expected but Bank
OL,4,Aof England facing tough choices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bank rate is crucial in setting the
OL,7,Fbenchmark for banks and other lenders
OL,8,Fin setting interest for individuals and
OL,9,Fbusinesses borrowing and saving money.
